{"id":"orchestrator-home","parent":"5t0tm7em","ord":"a1","title":"The deterministic orchestrator: olai drives the nondeterministic agent over ACP #needs-brainstorm","todo":true,"desc":"Re-scoped 2026-08-21 on the human's ruling (the eighth witness): there is no permanent fix inside the nondeterministic harness — the control flow leaves the model. Olai's orchestrator becomes a deterministic engine: gates flip from machine-checkable predicates (CI green = gh pr checks --required exit 0 at head; approval = one recorded bit; merge fires on pre-approved ∧ gates green), kolu watch events write the board mechanically, escalation policy is code (second nag on an unchanged block → forced re-derivation or human escalation), and the agent is invoked over the ACP chat seam as a function for judgment steps only (briefs, evidence verification, godly calls) whose answers the engine acts on mechanically. Full argument — the two-failure decomposition (delivery vs judgment), the sketch, the containment limit — in brainstorming/orchestrator.md, \"The seventh and eighth witnesses\". Supersedes the earlier formalize-the-prototype framing; absorbs olai-subscribes as the driver-loop piece.","changed":"2026-08-24T16:04:52-04:00","custom":{"brainstorm":"brainstorming/orchestrator.md § the seventh and eighth witnesses","rescoped":"the human 2026-08-21 — after RCA-1 (deaf watcher) and RCA-2 (manufactured gate) in one afternoon","rev2-supersedes":"2026-08-24 roadmap review: the cited \"§ the seventh and eighth witnesses\" anchor no longer exists — brainstorming/orchestrator.md is now REV 2 (2026-08-23), which reverses this node's premise: every model runs in a KOLU TERMINAL (the judge as a headless claude -p terminal on the subscription), olai opens no ACP sessions and spawns no agents; rev 2 re-homes this work under orchestrator-in-chat (features). This node's title (\"olai drives the agent over ACP\") states the rejected first-round design — rewrite or fold into orchestrator-in-chat before any dispatch"}}
{"id":"lane-chr","parent":"9hu6h48k","ord":"a1","title":"child-receptacle — one shared owner for subprocesses, @olai/child (Grok; pi) — AUTO-MERGE on the verified inventory","desc":"**merge** — ruled by the human 2026-08-24 ~15:50 (\"dispatch it to Grok, reviewer=pi, automerge\") — gate: pi review folded + CI green + the orchestrator verifying the before/after spawn-owner map against the diff\n\n**item** — infra → Server, logging & lifecycle)","see":["child-receptacle"],"created":"2026-08-24T15:49:13-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","brief":"briefs/chr.md","merge":"merge-auto","repo":"repo-olai","worktree":".worktrees/child-receptacle"}}
